Construct a ReuseNeed draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Recover the actual purpose behind recipient requests, separating essential performance from preferred form. Identify acceptable adaptations and nonnegotiable constraints, including evidence or specialist approval needed for unfamiliar materials or equipment.
